00:11:10,994 --> 00:11:12,994
Aya, can I ask you a question?

280
00:11:12,994 --> 00:11:13,994
It's crazy.

281
00:11:13,994 --> 00:11:14,994
It's okay, it's okay.

282
00:11:14,994 --> 00:11:15,994
It's not right.

283
00:11:15,994 --> 00:11:16,994
You were chosen, but it's time to go.

284
00:11:16,994 --> 00:11:18,994
I'd love to get some of Aya's emotional material.

285
00:11:19,994 --> 00:11:22,994
Then let me do it when you send Oshiro on his way.

286
00:11:22,994 --> 00:11:24,994
Can I ask you to give it your all?

287
00:11:24,994 --> 00:11:25,994
I'm on it.

288
00:11:25,994 --> 00:11:28,994
Yuzu to send Oshiro home!

289
00:11:28,994 --> 00:11:29,994
Emotion!

290
00:11:31,994 --> 00:11:32,994
Yuzu, are you beautiful?

291
00:11:33,994 --> 00:11:35,994
Involving, involving.

292
00:11:35,994 --> 00:11:37,994
See you all next time.

293
00:11:37,994 --> 00:11:39,994
Bye bye!
